            },
            "description": "Get featured experts for the customer home dashboard (MFS §9.7.3 / CUS-HOME-003). Selection is configurable, not hardcoded: (1) admin-pinned experts (isFeatured, respecting optional featuredUntil expiry) ordered by featuredRank, then (2) backfilled by active subscription tier (Elite > Professional > Core) with rating as the final tiebreaker. All candidates must satisfy marketplace eligibility (approved + search-eligible) and also appear in standard search. Each expert DTO now includes an `isFeatured` boolean. Optional `limit` query param: defaults to 10, minimum 1, maximum 50 (values above the max are clamped; non-numeric or zero values fall back to the default)."
          }
        },
